#! case: a Custom Action the game reports as failed fails its Plan and the Goal the Plan was for
#! rule: T1101
#! rule: 11 How failure spreads

#%[
AGENT guard PLAYS Guard:
    COUNT 1.
]#

EVENT intruder_seen(who)
ACTION chase(who)
GOAL catch(who)

PLAYBOOK Watching:
    WHEN intruder_seen(?x):
        PURSUE catch(?x), WITHOUT WAITING.

    TO catch(?x):
        DO chase(?x).

PLOT Watch:
    ROLE Guard STARTS WITH:
        ASSIGN Watching.
    PHASE calm INITIAL.
